  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Accelerating Innovative Monitoring For Forests and Commodities- Phase II AIM4C2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Phase 2 of project GCP /GLO/1327/GER(GIZ)
The project will enable to deploy at national level the solutions and allow producer associations to address short- and medium-term priority issues such as lack of geolocation data, digital divide or access to information. It will also contribute to ascertaining an enabling, pre-competitive, open-source and transparent digital environment for regulatory mechanisms on deforestation-free value chains, that can be used across any commodities.</narrative>
  </description>
